	spec: 'A choice field with preview: theme (the intro theme step and /theme) shows the theme its cursor is on in the terminal, live, without writing plugins/theme.ts. Closing the form (answer, skip, cancel) ends the preview: an answer leaves the chosen theme selected, a skip restores the saved one. plugins.preview runs a theme file in place of plugins/theme.ts and is never listed, saved or reported as loaded; plugins.unpreview restores theme.ts unless it reloaded meanwhile. The web ignores the flag for now.',
